meta {
  name: Resources - Get
  type: http
  seq: 54
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/z40cggggsksggkgskkwocock/resources/<cuid of a resource>
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  One resource of a resources space (ADR 0015), with its large field: the captured Markdown (capture.markdown, ADR 0018). capture is null when the page gave no readable content; capture_status says where the capture is. Lists never carry capture. Get a resource cuid with Resources - List. A resource of another space gives a 404.
}
